[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12540.71, "timestamp": "03:29:00", "text": "呃，发推文了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12544.79, "timestamp": "03:29:04", "text": "Zuchi 和 Celestia 的首次直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12547.429, "timestamp": "03:29:07", "text": "我转发和评论了这些内容，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12551.429, "timestamp": "03:29:11", "text": "看到Zuchi的……我简直震惊了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12554.229, "timestamp": "03:29:14", "text": "回复。我当时就想，“我的天哪，我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12563.349, "timestamp": "03:29:23", "text": "卡哇伊笨蛇推特点赞了我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12565.83, "timestamp": "03:29:25", "text": "直播间，点赞了我的评论。我当时就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12569.269, "timestamp": "03:29:29", "text": "我们走吧。然后，呃，来自呃，来自"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12571.349, "timestamp": "03:29:31", "text": "所有印度的 YouTuber 都像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12573.19, "timestamp": "03:29:33", "text": "太火了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12576.79, "timestamp": "03:29:36", "text": "他们当时就像是在宣传它一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12579.349, "timestamp": "03:29:39", "text": "是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12585.11, "timestamp": "03:29:45", "text": "可惜，呃，我睡着了，因为我睡着了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12588.469, "timestamp": "03:29:48", "text": "Zuchi 直播实际上是 Debbie 直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12591.67, "timestamp": "03:29:51", "text": "所以，我当时也在现场观看Celestia的直播。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12593.83, "timestamp": "03:29:53", "text": "我只能看着那个塞莱斯特，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12597.59, "timestamp": "03:29:57", "text": "但我确实重温了奶酪的首次亮相。"}]